{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜微軟全球故障辦公室淪遊樂場 打工仔打Golf練瑜伽 網民盼Teams一併停運           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">微軟（Microsoft）服務出現全球性故障，多地企業及政府部門運作受阻，高峰期間Downdetector接獲近13萬宗Outlook問題報告，服務其後陸續恢復，惟部分用戶仍遇到連線問題。故障期間辦公室頓成「遊樂場」，有打工仔踩單車、打高爾夫球、練瑜伽，台灣更有網民要求微軟連Teams亦一併停運，帖文獲逾1.8萬個讚好。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T04:19:20.258425+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T01:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:51.918999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:51.918999+00:00","content_hash":"7a1bf6697a25eabda65ecbc693e7717b95a8680f4162bf1ab9c4643ea3257eaa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}